      "writtenOn": "2025-11-12T16:39:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, `EmitFunction` should not be touched at all and `param-\u003eDepthMode()` should not be used. Updating `EmitStructType` alone should be enough.\n\nFYI Debugging basic.wgsl shows that `attributes.depth_mode.has_value()` is false, which suggests the attribute is not copying correct in the IOAttributes. Do you know where this done for MSL?",
      "parentUuid": "0eba0f5f_0c9ab49e",
      "revId": "5665177422dc93da21b96d04e383cdb06041c5c5",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
